1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Edward Tom's First Wife - Name Unknown=
2 CONT
2 CONT On Friday, January 03, 2020, I learned of 李顕妣 (Xiǎn Bǐ)'s existence from my paternal eldest aunt, 譚小英 (Xiǎo Yīng), in which she said that my paternal great grandfather, 譚松发 (Tōng Fāt), had a first wife who was the second mother to
2 CONC  my paternal grandfather, 譚沃榮 (Wò Róng), who passed away shortly after marriage due to illness and didn't have children.
2 CONT
2 CONT On Friday, April 24, 2020, my father said that the mountain in which 李顕妣 (Xiǎn Bǐ) was buried in was purchased by the government and that her grave was relocated to another cemetery. I believe this relocation event occurred in 201
2 CONC 5 because the tombstone says 2015.
2 CONT
2 CONT On Tuesday, April 06, 2021, my father said that 李顕妣 (Xiǎn Bǐ) was not Edward Tom's first wife's name and that we don't know what her name was nor do we know where she was from, but she was a part of the 李氏 (Lee Clan).
