1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Chen Kun Fang (陳坤芳)=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''陳坤芳 (Kūn Fāng)''' was born on April 10, 1908, in 水步乡 (Shuǐ Bù Xiāng).
2 CONT
2 CONT Her mother and father's names are unknown, but it was known that her father had two wives, and that she was the daughter of the first wife. After her mother passed away from illness, her father remarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to my paternal aunt, Xiao Ying Tan, my paternal great grandmother's father had two wives and she was the daughter of the first wife. She had a biological full brother and a biological half-sister, whose names are unknown
2 CONC  to me. It is unknown what happened to her biological brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between the years of 1924-1926, she marred my first great grandfather, 譚裔益 (Yì Yì), and had two children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between the years of 1960-1984, she enjoyed planting potatoes in the soil that used to belong to the house my paternal grandfather, 譚沃榮 (Wò Róng), was born in. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away from old age between the years of 1994 - 1997.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Updated on Wednesday, June 03, 2020.=
