1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =陳银伏 (Yín Fú)=
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Not much is known about 陳银伏 (Yín Fú), but according to 譚小英 (Xiǎo Yīng), she was a greedy and selfish person because after my paternal great grandfather (譚松发 - Tom Tong Fat) passed away on Sunday, May 05, 1935, his brother, 譚裔均 (Yì
2 CONC  Jūn), continued to send money back to China to my paternal great grandmother, Chen Kun Fang, but the money was intercepted and held onto by 陳银伏 (Yín Fú), which my family believes perpetuated the poverty my paternal grandfather ex
2 CONC perienced while growing up.
2 CONT
2 CONT 陳银伏 (Yín Fú) passed away in the early-1990s.
