1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =林洋佷 (Yáng Hěn)=
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT I don't know much about my paternal great grandfather, 林洋佷 (Yáng Hěn), but according to Soo Har Lam (Jenny Cheung's mother), he was originally from Fatshan/Foshan in 四九鄉 (Sijiu Township/49 Township).
2 CONT
2 CONT Based on stories that my father told me while growing up, 林洋佷 (Yáng Hěn), tend to eat leftover food often, which was something my father didn't like very much about him.
2 CONT
2 CONT 林洋佷 (Yáng Hěn) passed away at the age of 64 on Saturday, February 12, 1977, most likely from illness.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had a younger sister named 林銀伏 (Yín Fú) who immigrated to the United States (New York City) and became a landlord + butcher shop proprietor.
2 CONT
2 CONT On Thursday, March 16, 2023, my father informed me that my great grandfather died from Shingles?
