1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =林卓羡 (Zhuō Xiàn) - Cheuk Soon Lam=
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Early Life:==
2 CONT
2 CONT Cheuk Soon Lam (Chinese: 林卓羡; Wednesday, November 15, 1939 - Wednesday, December 19, 1990) was born in Chaoyang Village (潮陽村), Sijiu Township (四九镇), Jiangmen (江門), Taishan County (台山市), Guangdong Province (廣東), Republic of China (
2 CONC 中華民國) as the third child and second son of 林洋佷 (Yáng Hěn) and 雷挂鳳 (Guà Fèng).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Death:==
2 CONT
2 CONT Cheuk Soon Lam passed away on Wednesday, December 19, 1990, from an unknown form of cancer.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes:==
2 CONT
2 CONT At the time of writing this entry, not much is known about Cheuk Soon Lam, other than the fact he helped my father when my father was younger.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Burial:==
2 CONT
2 CONT 林卓羡 (Zhuō Xiàn) is currently buried in The Evergreens Cemetery in Section Gibron Plot #XXVII-112.
