2 CONT 李金杏 (Jīn Xìng) was the mother of my maternal grandmother, 梁嬋佩 (Chán Pèi), as well as the mother of 梁庭樞 (Tíng Shū) and 梁碧華 (Bì Huá).
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born around 1895-1910 and married 梁偉猷 (Wěi Yóu). 
