2 CONT According to Mark Lazar's Facebook post from November 11, 2015, his father, Robert Lazar, served in the United States Army for 28 years and is a Korean Veteran. This most likely meant he fought in the Korean War from June 25, 1950
2 CONC  – July 27, 1953.
2 CONT
