1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Michael R. Lazar (b. September 01, 1951 - d. October 09, 2010)=
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael R. Lazar is the son of Robert Lazar and Doreen Chung (Young).
2 CONT
2 CONT After his mother, Doreen Chung passed away, his father, Robert Lazar remarried and had two other sons, whom his step-mother favored.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Steven Gildea, Michael R. Lazar was sent to live with his mother's side of the family after his father remarried, and rarely if ever interacted with the Chung (Young) side of the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael eventually married and had a son named Jeff Lazar, whom he only saw several times in his life.
2 CONT
2 CONT He passed away on October 09, 2010, at the age of 59. A photo of him and his mother was found in his wallet.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Obituary:==
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael R. “Mickey” Lazar, 59, of Gap View Mobile Home Park, Walnutport, formerly of Lansford died on October 9, 2010, at his residence. Born in England, he was the son of the late Robert and Doreen Lazar and Step-Mother Eva (Firk
2 CONC al) Lazar of Lansford. He was a carpenter, last working at Lehigh Valley Refractor Concrete. He was of the Catholic Faith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving along with his Step-Mother is a son, Jeff Lazar and his wife Jamie of Lansford; Brothers, Mark Lazar, and his wife Helene of Summit Hill and Robert Lazar Jr. of Lansford; a Grandson, Derek Lazar.
2 CONT Funeral Service will be at the convenience of the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrangements are being handled by the Skrabak-Parambo Funeral Home, 210 E. Bertsch St., Lansford. Online condolences may be signed at www.parambofh.com.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: [https://www.parambofh.com/index.cfm/obituary/1009524?browse_on=desktop]
