1 NAME HUANG Qin, 黄勤 21A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 21st generation. Approximately 1650 BC to _____.  Son of Shu (蜀).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Xia (夏后期) period when the Xia Dynasty, after Emperor Yin (胤, 1622 BC - 1615 BC), was in decline. Shang (商) was rising in the East.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Gen (根).
2 CONT
2 CONT 二十一世。约公元前1650 ---。蜀之子, 根之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 夏朝衰落, 商在东方强盛。帝胤 (公元前1622 - 公元前1615) 以后, 商在东方强盛, 夏不敢向东方竞争。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
