2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and Shen Yucheng, Zhongguo wenxuejia dacidian, 395. 
2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and Fu Gang, Xiao Tong pingzhuan, 103–4. 
2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and Shen Yucheng, Zhonggu wenshi ziliao congkao, 584–85. 
2 CONT * Cao Daoheng 曹道衡. Lanling Xiaoshi yu Nanchao wenxue 蘭陵蕭氏與南朝文學, 85–86, 124–25. Beijing: Zhonghua shuju, 2004. 
2 CONT * Wu Guoping 烏國平. “Lun Liangdai shiren Xiao Zong” 論梁代詩人蕭綜. Wenxue yichan (2009: 5): 53–61. 
2 CONT * Ge Zhiwei 葛志偉. “Xiao Zong shengzu nian kao” 蕭綜生卒年考. Wen xuan yichan (2009: 5): 61.
