1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 37th generation. Approximately 1230 BC to _____. Son of Bei (惫)/Tiao (儵).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Minister of Finance and Supplies (历正, 迁治票内史) and, subsequently, Chief Minister (卿士) during the Shang (商) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Lin Gong (林公).
2 CONT
2 CONT 三十七世。约公元前1230 ---。惫之子, 林公之父。商朝时封历正, 迁治粟内史 (掌管财政), 出为卿士。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
