1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Chén Zhào 陳兆 [Sêl] was a district magistrate. He had three sons: Chén Wén 陳文 [Mũn], Chén Jì 陳紀 [Gï] and 陳綱 Chén Gāng [Göng]. He lost his position as district magistrate and was banished to Sìchuān 四川 [Xü Chün]  Pro
2 CONC vince. He took two sons, Chén Jì 陳紀 [Gï] and 陳綱 Chén Gāng [Göng] with him. 
